# origin=frame. GtkBackend (Homebrew GTK 4.24.1) on macOS: the window is an NSWindow with the native 28 pt title bar, 560x720 pt content, captured at 560x748 px, i.e. scale 1; read off p84-macos-gtk4-final-20261009-201356.png: sample buttons 1-5 at y 282 (1 x 175, 2 x 225, 3 x 274, 4 x 324, 5 x 375), smaller x 142 and larger x 225 at y 348. GTK buttons are taller and wider than AppKit's, so the AppKit files miss them.
